rooms_desc ({"You are in entrance to Muf's palace.You have invitation so come in and rest here.To the north you see door to palace.","You are in Palace's hall. Here is fountain in centre of room.There are doors in all directions. There are also two goldenstatues in real sizes.","Welcome in Muf's bar. This is the best room in Muf's palaceHere is nice bar, fridge, medikit and some armchairs.","You are enter Muf's beautifull bedroom.Room is entire pink andhere is a big bed dominating near wall.From the window you can see nice mountains and lake under its.Here is also small statue and picture on wall.","This is rather dark but very comfortable looking room.A thick black rug covers the wide floor, and soft furnitureand cushions provide for cozy relaxation. The room itselfis used for relaxation and for a respite from the hecticoutside world. There are armchairs, flower and statue in corner.","This is Muf's balcony. He often sits here and dreams about quests,life, friends and love.Here is nice view to Holly Mission and mountains with red sunset.If you look arround you can see slot machine on wall and some armchairs.Here is picture on west wall.",0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Entrance to Palace","Palace's hall","Muf's bar","Muf's bedroom","Muf's restroom","Muf's balcony",0,0,0,0,})
